  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till statistik 2025 - 2029</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Statistics 2025- 2029 - Support to Statistics 2025- 2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve INSTATs overall capacity to fulfil is duties as described in the Law on Official Statistics and the Official Statistics Program, as well as the requirements of the EU acquis in the field of statistics (Chapter 18). The project will enhance INSTATs ability to produce and disseminate quality statistics, and to fully take on the role as coordinator of the Albanian NSS.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;reslagna samarbetet mellan INSTAT och Statistiska centralbyr&#xe5;n (SCB) kommer att syfta till att st&#xe4;rka INSTATs f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att anpassa sig till lagen om officiell statistik och programmet f&#xf6;r officiell statistik, samt kraven i EU:s regelverk p&#xe5; statistikomr&#xe5;det. Trots anm&#xe4;rkningsv&#xe4;rda framsteg, som noterats i EU 2024-rapporten, &#xe4;r Albanien fortfarande m&#xe5;ttligt f&#xf6;rberett p&#xe5; statistikomr&#xe5;det. Denna &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rd f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra tillg&#xe4;ngligheten av statistik i enlighet med anv&#xe4;ndarnas behov och g&#xf6;ra INSTAT kapabelt att fullt ut ta p&#xe5; sig rollen som samordnare f&#xf6;r det albanska nationella statistiksystemet (NSS) samt att uppfylla EU:s krav p&#xe5; statistikproduktion</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed cooperation between INSTAT and Statistics Sweden (SCB) will aim to strengthen INSTAT&#x2019;s capacity to align with the Law on Official Statistics and the Official Statistics Program, as well as the requirements of the EU acquis in the field of statistics. Despite notable progress, as noted in EU 2024 Report, Albania remains moderately prepared in the area of statistics. This intervention is expected to improve availability of statistics in accordance to user needs and make INSTAT capable to fully take on the role as coordinator of the Albanian
National Statistical System (NSS) as well as to comply with EU requirments on statistics production.</narrative>
  </description>
